  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "エネルギーの　つまった　アメ。\nあたえると　ポケモン　１ひきの\nけいけんちが　すこし　ふえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "에너지가 가득한 사탕.\n먹이면 포켓몬 1마리의\n경험치가 조금 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "充滿能量的糖果。\n餵給寶可夢後，\n能讓１隻寶可夢增加少量經驗值。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un bonbon plein d’énergie.\nIl permet à un Pokémon de gagner un peu de Points\nd’Expérience.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Bonbon, das voller Energie steckt. Beim Verzehr\nerhält das Pokémon eine geringe Menge an\nErfahrungspunkten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Caramelo energético que aumenta ligeramente los\nPuntos de Experiencia de un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Caramella altamente energetica che aumenta di poco\ni Punti Esperienza di un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it\nwill grant a single Pokémon a small amount of\nExp. Points.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "エネルギーの　つまった　アメ。\n与えると　ポケモン　１匹の\n経験値が　少し　増える。",
